<title>EGYPT: Apache, Global find oil in Egypt.</title>
<headline>Apache, Global find oil in Egypt.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's Oil Ministry said on Monday Apache Corp and Global Resources Inc had made another crude find in the southwestern Qarun concession.</p>
<p>It said a test well has yielded 3,700 barrels of oil per day and that the Qarun drilling firm working on the concession found a 100-metre thick crude strata which it tested at depths of 3,030 metres and 2,800 metres.</p>
<p>The companies have already made two finds in the concession. The Qarun SW1 test well yielded crude of 40 degrees gravity.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/91</p>
</text>
